@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071/api
@token = replace-with-customer-token
@subscriptionId = replace-with-subscription-id

### Pause (7-day subscription: 1 pause/3 days; 14-day: 1/5; 30-day: 2/7)
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/{{subscriptionId}}/pause
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "days": 3
}

### Invalid duration: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/{{subscriptionId}}/pause
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "days": 8
}

### Resume early; partial days round up, capped at the selected pause duration
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/{{subscriptionId}}/resume
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Includes lifetime pausesRemaining, pauseLimit, maxPauseDays and the UTC automatic-resume timestamp
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/my
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
